@startuml
title Plane State Transition Diagram

state Order
Order : entry / newly acquired plane
Order : do / placed in order state until delivery
Order : exit / delivered to arrival

state Arrival
Arrival : entry / upon arrival
Arrival : do / transition to preparation
Arrival : exit / moved to preparation

state Preparation <<choice>>
Preparation : entry / after arrival
Preparation : do / prepare the plane
Preparation : exit / ready for assignment

state Operations
Operations : entry / assigned to operations
Operations : do / check scheduled flights
Operations : exit / remains in operations if flights exist

state Maintenance
Maintenance : entry / no more flights or maintenance needed
Maintenance : do / servicing and checks
Maintenance : exit / ready for preparation

state Retired
Retired : entry / permanently withdrawn from service
Retired : do / removed from operations
Retired : exit / final state

[*] --> Order

Order --> Arrival : delivered

Arrival --> Preparation

Preparation --> Operations : [condition met]
Preparation --> Maintenance : [maintenance required]

Operations --> Maintenance : [no more flights or maintenance needed]

Maintenance --> Preparation : serviced and ready

Preparation --> Retired : [plane retired]

Operations --> Retired : [plane retired]

Retired --> [*] : removed from service
@enduml
